{"assets":[],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"2159","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"A. MAD Interactive Problem"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"2 seconds"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"256 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"This is an interactive problem."}],"kind":"container"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"There is a secret sequence $$$a_1, a_2, \\ldots, a_{2n-1},a_{2n}$$$, which contains each integer from $$$1$$$ to $$$n$$$ "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"exactly twice"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Your task is to guess the sequence by using queries of the following type:"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"attrs":{"ordered":false},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" \"? $$$k\\;j_1\\;j_2\\;\\ldots\\;j_k$$$\" — select the integer $$$k$$$ ($$$1 \\le k \\le 2n$$$) and $$$k$$$ "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"distinct"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" indices $$$j_1, j_2, \\ldots, j_k$$$ ($$$1 \\le j_1 , j_2 , \\ldots , j_k \\le 2n$$$). In response to the query, the jury will return $$$\\text{MAD}([a_{j_1}, a_{j_2}, \\ldots, a_{j_k}])$$$. "}],"kind":"list_item"}],"kind":"list"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"We define the $$$\\operatorname{MAD}$$$ (Maximum Appearing Duplicate) of an integer sequence as the largest integer that appears at least twice. Specifically, if there is no number that appears at least twice, the $$$\\operatorname{MAD}$$$ value is $$$0$$$. Some examples are as follows:"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"attrs":{"ordered":false},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" $$$\\operatorname{MAD}([1, 2, 1]) = 1$$$; "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" $$$\\operatorname{MAD}([2, 2, 3, 3]) = 3$$$; "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" $$$\\operatorname{MAD}([1, 2, 3, 4]) = 0$$$. "}],"kind":"list_item"}],"kind":"list"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Please identify the secret sequence "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"using at most $$$3n$$$ queries"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Each test contains multiple test cases. The first line contains the number of test cases $$$t$$$ ($$$1 \\le t \\le 3000$$$). The description of the test cases follows. "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line of each test case contains one integer $$$n$$$ ($$$2 \\le n \\le 300$$$)."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"It is guaranteed that the sum of $$$n^2$$$ over all test cases does not exceed $$$10^5$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"After you read this line of input, the interaction begins with your first query."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"custom","title":"Interaction"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Interaction"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"To make a query, output a line (without quotes) in the following format:"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"attrs":{"ordered":false},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"? "}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"$$$k\\;j_1\\;j_2\\;\\ldots\\;j_k$$$\" ($$$1 \\le k \\le 2n$$$, $$$1 \\le j_1 , j_2 , \\ldots , j_k \\le 2n$$$) "}],"kind":"list_item"}],"kind":"list"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Here, the indices $$$j_1 , j_2 , \\ldots , j_k$$$ which you selected must be "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"pairwise distinct"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Then, after each query, read a single integer — the answer to your query."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"You can make at most $$$3n$$$ queries of this type."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"If your program has found the sequence $$$a$$$, print the line (without quotes) in the following format:"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"attrs":{"ordered":false},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"! "}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"$$$a_1\\;a_2\\;\\ldots\\;a_{2n-1}\\;a_{2n}$$$\" ($$$1 \\le a_i \\le n$$$) "}],"kind":"list_item"}],"kind":"list"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Note that this does not count towards the query limit."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"After this, proceed to the next test case, or exit if this is the last test case."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The interactor in this task is "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"not adaptive"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":". In other words, the sequence $$$a$$$ does not change during the interaction."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"If you make more than $$$3n$$$ queries during an interaction, your program must terminate immediately, and you will receive the "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Wrong Answer"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" verdict. Otherwise, you can get an arbitrary verdict because your solution will continue to read from a closed stream."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"After printing each line, do not forget to output the end of line and flush the output buffer. Otherwise, you will receive the "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Idleness Limit Exceeded"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" verdict. To flush, use:"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"attrs":{"ordered":false},"children":[{"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"fflush(stdout)"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" or "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"cout.flush()"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" in C++; "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"System.out.flush()"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" in Java; "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"stdout.flush()"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" in Python; "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" see the documentation for other languages. "}],"kind":"list_item"}],"kind":"list"},{"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Hacks"}],"kind":"container"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"To make a hack, please use the following format:"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line should contain the number of test cases $$$t$$$ ($$$1 \\leq t \\leq 3000$$$)."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line of each test case should contain an integer $$$n$$$ ($$$2 \\leq n \\leq 300$$$)."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The following line should contain $$$2n$$$ integers $$$a_1,a_2,\\ldots,a_{2n}$$$ ($$$1 \\leq a_i \\leq n$$$). Each number from $$$1$$$ through $$$n$$$ must appear exactly twice."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The sum of $$$n^2$$$ over all test cases should not exceed $$$10^5$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"For example, the hack format corresponding to the example interaction is as follows. "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"2\n2\n2 2 1 1\n2\n1 2 1 2\n\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Example"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n2\n2\n\n2\n\n0\n\n1\n\n2\n\n0\n\n1\n\n1\n\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n\n\n? 2 2 1\n\n? 2 1 3\n\n? 3 1 3 4\n\n! 2 2 1 1\n\n? 2 1 2\n\n? 2 1 3\n\n? 3 1 3 4\n\n! 1 2 1 2\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"note"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Note"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the first test case, the hidden sequence is $$$a=[2,2,1,1]$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"For the query \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"? 2 2 1"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\", the jury returns $$$2$$$ because $$$\\operatorname{MAD}([a_2, a_1]) = \\operatorname{MAD}([2, 2]) = 2$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"For the query \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"? 2 1 3"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\", the jury returns $$$0$$$ because $$$\\operatorname{MAD}([a_1, a_3]) = \\operatorname{MAD}([2, 1]) = 0$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"For the query \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"? 3 1 3 4"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\", the jury returns $$$1$$$ because $$$\\operatorname{MAD}([a_1, a_3, a_4]) = \\operatorname{MAD}([2 ,1, 1]) = 1$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Note that the example interaction is only for understanding statements and does "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"not"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" guarantee finding a unique sequence $$$a$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"document"},"index":"A","problemCode":"2159A","schema":2,"sourceKind":"html","sourceUrl":"https://codeforces.com/contest/2159/problem/A"}